sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Applicant
  participant FE as Next.js frontend
  participant API as FastAPI backend
  participant AI as AI service
  participant LLM as LLM API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  actor ADM as Administrator

  rect rgb(240, 245, 255)
  Note over A,DB: Onboarding
  A->>FE: Answer onboarding questions
  FE->>API: POST /onboarding/messages (JWT)
  API->>AI: Message and conversation
  AI->>LLM: Extract profile fields
  LLM-->>AI: Structured fields
  AI-->>API: Proposed profile
  API-->>FE: Proposed profile and next question
  A->>FE: Confirm profile
  FE->>API: PUT /profile
  API->>DB: Save profile
  end

  rect rgb(240, 255, 245)
  Note over A,DB: Eligibility analysis
  A->>FE: Open a programme
  FE->>API: GET /programmes/{slug}/eligibility
  API->>DB: Profile, requirements, sources, status
  DB-->>API: Records
  API->>API: Deterministic rules: Met, Not met, Pending, Unknown
  API-->>FE: Results with sources, dates and gaps
  FE->>API: GET /applications/{id}/roadmap
  API->>DB: Save generated tasks
  API-->>FE: Ordered tasks with dates
  end

  rect rgb(255, 248, 235)
  Note over A,DB: AI advisor
  A->>FE: Ask a question
  FE->>API: POST /advisor/messages
  API->>AI: Question and profile
  AI->>DB: Retrieve Verified records by SQL
  DB-->>AI: Records with sources
  alt Verified records found
    AI->>LLM: Question and records only
    LLM-->>AI: Draft answer
    AI->>AI: Check citations
    AI-->>API: Answer with citations
  else Nothing verified
    AI-->>API: Refusal and a pointer to the official source
  end
  API-->>FE: Reply
  end

  rect rgb(250, 240, 245)
  Note over A,ADM: Administrator verification
  A->>FE: Ask to re-verify a record
  ADM->>FE: Open the verification queue
  FE->>API: PATCH /requirements/{id}/status
  API->>API: Only a Tier 1 source can make a record Verified
  API->>DB: Update status and write the audit entry
  API-->>FE: Updated record
  end
